{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-05_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-04","title":"分水嶺線","storyCode":"16-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"532e8d83199ee9643381c65bd3e0858c11350daa3ef7bcf107eda9f30c60cd52","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士和Mon3tr從自殺未遂的研究員科謝尼婭口中得知疑似有內衛被殺的消息。一行人重新制定了行動計劃，決定兵分兩路。幾天前，礦工們利用晶片設下埋伏，襲擊了糾察隊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g10_instituteinterior"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯，遠北中心礦區研究所</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛……是不是說了“內衛”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我聽到她說的是……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"殺死內衛。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的意思是……這種叫“奧卡”的物質，殺死了內衛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有可能嗎？難道這是某種比“國度”更恐怖的邪魔產物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一種從礦井中發現的未知物質。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"研究所用它分別在感染者和非感染者身上做了實驗。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"實驗結果顯示，它會使感染者的病情加重。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，這是這裡的研究員對某種物質的特殊稱呼，在見到實物之前，我們都沒辦法下定論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，科謝尼婭！看著我，你還能再想起什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……你是……"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr以為這次呼喚會與之前一樣毫無收穫，但女人迷濛的雙眼卻忽地睜大了。\n緊接著，她反手死死抓住眼前人的衣服，把Mon3tr拉到身前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——您是所長？凱爾希所長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您來接我了嗎？我想回去，我還想見到老師——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想見伊利亞老師……還有柳達……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們……他們還想見我嗎？我這麼懦弱，什麼也做不到……我還有資格見到他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……嗚嗚——啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我——"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而還沒等Mon3tr作出回應，女人又猛地放手，跌坐回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是凱爾希所長。我再也沒見過她了，就像我再也沒見過其他人。她不該在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至見過她後來的同伴，他們……他們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過？你見過誰？是不是一位個子小小的、總是面帶微笑的黎博利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎博利……是啊，我見過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那群殺死內衛的人……那些感染者，她之前和那些人在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會死！所有人都會死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……我不知道——我不知道……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她需要鎮靜劑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她有脫水的症狀。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這些消息——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"礦工的逃跑與內衛有關。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Mantra說過內衛造成的汙染在向南蔓延。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"答案已經很明顯了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，內衛真的被殺了嗎？被一群礦工？這有可能嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許我們應該考慮……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"如果這是真的，那將代表著什麼。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女大公封鎖礦區的真正目的，是為了隱藏有個內衛死在了她的轄區的事實？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不可能！無論是皇帝還是集團軍都不會善罷甘休的，如果她真的想要掩蓋這件事，一開始就不會答應讓我們進入礦區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那位近衛軍，她知道這件事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒錯……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這些正是我們需要擔心的事。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"先通知Mantra和阿米婭吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g9_institutecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡同樣有些發現，與你們得到的情報相符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個場所內有打鬥痕跡，並且遺落了一些醫療用品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是來自羅德島的醫療用品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們馬上跟你們會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了……博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們馬上就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？你的同伴那邊有什麼發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕需要我們會合後才能說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤小姐，這裡還有什麼需要注意的線索嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所知有限，找不到什麼更有效的訊息，有必要的話，等一下讓那位博士親自來查看也無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這倒是更加讓我確信了軍方毫無底線……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤小姐，我想問，對於發生在礦區的事，您還知道什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是想問什麼？這座研究所裡的實驗還是發生變異的感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭向來抗拒在這樣的情況下以這種方式使用自己的能力，但她仍舊嘗試觸碰了眼前這位近衛軍的思緒。\n阿洛伊澤的心頭滿是陰霾和疑惑，卻並未摻雜心虛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g10_instituteinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這些資料……還有遺書，該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這份遺書沒有提及太多與石棺有關的內容。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那位近衛軍提供了不少情報，我們也該適當地回報。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"靠近的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是在這邊嗎？還真是難找……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"靠近的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然，藏得這麼深，一定有秘密——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，這是誰？"},{"type":"narration","text":"近衛軍的目光投向斜靠在牆邊那名面色蒼白、雙目緊閉的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，一個沒有撤離的研究員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究所與流動醫療隊可能有往來，本來想問她我們那些同伴的去向，但她的精神恍惚、嚴重脫水，不適合繼續詢問她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那地上這些蠟燭和線路又是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我猜，這是她為自我了斷所做的準備。博士，這裡到底發生了什麼事情？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們及時趕到，阻止了爆炸發生。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"情況很複雜。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上拿的那些文件是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"遺書，你也看看吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（遞給她）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……一事無成的研究員，名叫“奧卡”的神秘物質……人體實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子，我們在下面見到的那些死者，是被這個“奧卡”殺死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡真的在做人體實驗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，我當時只是說說而已——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看來女大公果真隱瞞了很多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這個實驗的目的是什麼？這裡的研究員會使用這種卑劣的手段，我並不意外，但他們肯定有什麼企圖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位研究員呢？她什麼也沒說嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看起來有些研究資料已經被人為銷毀了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"但不確定是礦工還是這裡的研究員自己銷毀的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們還是不知道那些變異感染者誕生的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起碼我們現在知道這裡還有活下來的礦工逃走了，先不論這位研究員，那些逃走的礦工很有可能就是整件事的唯一切入點了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那些感染者礦工在洗劫了研究所後離開了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他們往南去了，這是唯一的線索。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的動作要快點了……這位研究員恢復到可以接受詢問的狀態還需要多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很難預估。她嚴重脫水，剛見面時精神狀況也很糟糕，我們得先幫她治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真麻煩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還不清楚礦工已經逃跑多久了，既然知道了方向，就必須盡快追上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不可能帶著沒有行動能力的傷員上路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我和Mon3tr留下照顧科謝尼婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你們去追蹤離開的礦工隊伍。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……你們確定要單獨留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這是你們的自由，但我還是有必要提醒你們一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒有人知道遠北這些礦區都處於什麼樣的狀態，同樣也沒有人能保障你們的安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們有能力保護好自己的安全。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們可以相信阿米婭的指揮。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以的，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"相信你自己的判斷。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會和阿米婭一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，希望你們一切順利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等科謝尼婭恢復行動能力，我們就去找你們會合。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"離開汙染區之後，通訊應該會逐漸恢復。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，如果通訊一直沒有恢復，那我們找到那群礦工之後就回研究所和你們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，現在備案也有了，我們快點出發吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北中心礦區</><p=2>三天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在這邊……快點過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你幹嘛用跑的！這個爛定位時好時壞，說不定根本不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"上次有個礦場的馱獸為了找草吃跑出了界，那時牠跑了十幾公里之後這個東西才發送訊號給崗哨，誰知道這次會不會也是一樣的情況？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"按理說這些人不該出現在南出口周圍，這條路早就封了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你怎麼會從那邊過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，你不是我們隊的吧？你在這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想問你呢。這裡不在你們隊的管轄範圍內吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"現在早就沒人在管什麼轄不轄區了，誰先接到消息、先找到逃跑的感染者，那功勞就是誰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"走開，別擋路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"照你的說法，是我們先來的，那這次的功勞應該是我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"誰找到就*烏薩斯粗口*算誰的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"托夏，你幹嘛啦？不要跟他講那麼多廢話，先找人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這邊！他們都躲在——哈哈哈哈啊哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"他笑成這樣，是發現什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"走，過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前面有個不深不淺的洞，那幾個礦工就躲在裡面，還以為我們發現不了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，哈哈哈哈哈啊哈哈……這太好笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。他們以為那是什麼，戰壕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"托夏、戈沙，帶著所有人，你們快點過去把那些馱獸不如的笨蛋給我抓出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"從定位上來看，這些逃竄的感染者礦工數量還不少呢，需要幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你們隊有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不多，加上我也只有六個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你怎麼說。我們是這附近僅剩的兩支有空的隊伍，而且是我們先來這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"這次的功勞，就算你們不想分，也得算我們一份。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"散漫的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"尖叫聲打破了兩支隊伍的對峙。\n緊隨其後的是肢體搏鬥、鈍器砸碎骨肉的聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"糾察隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！救我！他們都瘋了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的糾察隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些該死的感染者都*烏薩斯粗口*瘋了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓你們見識一下，感染者的憤怒，還有瘋狂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["極境"]}]}
